#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:4
msgid "Conditional Workflow Tasks"
msgstr "Tâches de workflow conditionnel"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:9
msgid ""
"Conditional Workflow Tasks provide branching logic within |morpheus| "
"Workflows. A Conditional Workflow Task evaluates a JavaScript expression "
"and, based on the result, executes one of two Operational Workflows — "
"enabling dynamic, decision-based automation chains."
msgstr "Les tâches de workflow conditionnel fournissent une logique de branchement au sein des workflows |morpheus|. Une tâche de workflow conditionnel évalue une expression JavaScript et, selon le résultat, exécute l'un des deux workflows opérationnels, ce qui permet des chaînes d'automatisation dynamiques basées sur des décisions."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:11
msgid ""
"This task type is found in :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` "
"(Library > Automation > Tasks) with the type **Conditional Workflow**."
msgstr "Ce type de tâche se trouve dans :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` (Library > Automation > Tasks) avec le type **Conditional Workflow**."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:14
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Fonctionnement"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:16
msgid "The Conditional Workflow Task operates on a simple if/else model:"
msgstr "La tâche de workflow conditionnel fonctionne selon un modèle if/else simple :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:18
msgid "A JavaScript expression is evaluated"
msgstr "Une expression JavaScript est évaluée"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:19
msgid "If the expression resolves to ``true``, the **If Workflow** is executed"
msgstr "Si l'expression se résout en ``true``, le **If Workflow** est exécuté"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:20
msgid "If the expression resolves to ``false``, the **Else Workflow** is executed"
msgstr "Si l'expression se résout en ``false``, le **Else Workflow** est exécuté"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:21
msgid "The parent Workflow continues after the conditional branch completes"
msgstr "Le workflow parent continue après la fin de la branche conditionnelle"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:23
msgid ""
"Parent Workflow\n"
"├── Task 1\n"
"├── Conditional Workflow Task\n"
"│   ├── [true]  → If Operational Workflow\n"
"│   └── [false] → Else Operational Workflow\n"
"└── Task 3 (continues after conditional)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:33
msgid "Creating a Conditional Workflow Task"
msgstr "Création d'une tâche de workflow conditionnel"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:35
msgid "Navigate to :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` > Tasks"
msgstr "Accédez à :menuselection:`Library --> Automation` > Tasks"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:36
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Cliquez sur :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:37
msgid "Select **Conditional Workflow** as the Task Type"
msgstr "Sélectionnez **Conditional Workflow** comme type de tâche"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:38
msgid "Configure the Task:"
msgstr "Configurez la tâche :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:40
msgid "**NAME:** Descriptive name for the conditional task"
msgstr "**NAME:** Nom descriptif pour la tâche conditionnelle"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:41
msgid "**CODE:** Unique code for API, CLI, and variable references"
msgstr "**CODE:** Code unique pour les références API, CLI et variables"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:42
msgid "**LABELS:** Comma-separated labels for organization"
msgstr "**LABELS:** Étiquettes séparées par des virgules pour l'organisation"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:43
msgid ""
"**CONDITIONAL (JS):** JavaScript expression that evaluates to ``true`` or"
" ``false``"
msgstr "**CONDITIONAL (JS):** Expression JavaScript qui s'évalue à ``true`` ou ``false``"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:44
msgid ""
"**IF OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW:** The Workflow to execute when the condition "
"is true"
msgstr "**IF OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW:** Le workflow à exécuter lorsque la condition est vraie"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:45
msgid ""
"**ELSE OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW:** The Workflow to execute when the condition"
" is false"
msgstr "**ELSE OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW:** Le workflow à exécuter lorsque la condition est fausse"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:47
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Cliquez sur :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:50
msgid "JavaScript Conditional Syntax"
msgstr "Syntaxe conditionnelle JavaScript"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:52
msgid ""
"The **CONDITIONAL (JS)** field accepts JavaScript expressions. The "
"expression must resolve to a truthy or falsy value."
msgstr "Le champ **CONDITIONAL (JS)** accepte des expressions JavaScript. L'expression doit se résoudre en une valeur truthy ou falsy."

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:55
msgid "Simple Comparisons"
msgstr "Comparaisons simples"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:57
msgid ""
"// Check instance type\n"
"\"<%= instance.instanceTypeName %>\" === \"nginx\"\n"
"\n"
"// Check cloud type\n"
"\"<%= zone.zoneType.code %>\" === \"vmware\"\n"
"\n"
"// Numeric comparison\n"
"parseInt(\"<%= instance.maxMemory %>\") > 1073741824"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:69
msgid "Variable References"
msgstr "Références de variables"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:71
msgid ""
"|morpheus| variables can be injected into the JavaScript expression using"
" ``<%= %>`` syntax:"
msgstr "Les variables |morpheus| peuvent être injectées dans l'expression JavaScript à l'aide de la syntaxe ``<%= %>`` :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:73
msgid ""
"// Check custom option value\n"
"\"<%= customOptions.environment %>\" === \"production\"\n"
"\n"
"// Check instance status\n"
"\"<%= instance.status %>\" === \"running\"\n"
"\n"
"// Check group membership\n"
"\"<%= instance.group.name %>\" === \"Web Tier\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:85
msgid "Using Task Results"
msgstr "Utilisation des résultats de tâche"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:87
msgid "Results from prior Tasks in the Workflow can be referenced:"
msgstr "Les résultats de tâches antérieures dans le workflow peuvent être référencés :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:89
msgid ""
"// Check result from a previous task (by task code)\n"
"\"<%= results.healthCheck %>\" === \"healthy\"\n"
"\n"
"// Boolean from prior task\n"
"\"<%= results.validationTask %>\" === \"true\"\n"
"\n"
"// Check if result contains a value\n"
"\"<%= results.checkStatus %>\".indexOf(\"SUCCESS\") >= 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:101
msgid "Complex Conditions"
msgstr "Conditions complexes"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:103
msgid "Multiple conditions can be combined:"
msgstr "Plusieurs conditions peuvent être combinées :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:105
msgid ""
"// AND condition\n"
"\"<%= customOptions.tier %>\" === \"web\" && \"<%= zone.name %>\" === "
"\"Production\"\n"
"\n"
"// OR condition\n"
"\"<%= instance.plan.name %>\".indexOf(\"large\") >= 0 || parseInt(\"<%= "
"instance.maxCores %>\") > 4\n"
"\n"
"// Negation\n"
"\"<%= instance.status %>\" !== \"suspended\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:117
msgid "Result Propagation"
msgstr "Propagation des résultats"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:119
msgid "When a Conditional Workflow Task executes a sub-workflow:"
msgstr "Lorsqu'une tâche de workflow conditionnel exécute un sous-workflow :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Task Results:** Results from Tasks within the If/Else workflow are "
"accessible to subsequent Tasks in the parent Workflow via "
"``results.taskCode``"
msgstr "**Task Results:** Les résultats des tâches du workflow If/Else sont accessibles aux tâches suivantes du workflow parent via ``results.taskCode``"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:122
msgid "**Error Handling:** If a Task within the sub-workflow fails:"
msgstr "**Error Handling:** Si une tâche du sous-workflow échoue :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:124
msgid ""
"If **Continue on Error** is set on the conditional task, the parent "
"Workflow continues"
msgstr "Si **Continue on Error** est défini sur la tâche conditionnelle, le workflow parent continue"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:125
msgid "If not set, the parent Workflow fails"
msgstr "Si ce n'est pas le cas, le workflow parent échoue"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Output:** The conditional task itself does not produce a result value; "
"results come from the individual Tasks within the executed sub-workflow"
msgstr "**Output:** La tâche conditionnelle elle-même ne produit pas de valeur de résultat ; les résultats proviennent des tâches individuelles du sous-workflow exécuté"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:130
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr "Bonnes pratiques"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Keep conditions simple:** Complex logic should be in a preceding Script"
" Task that outputs a simple value for the conditional to evaluate"
msgstr "**Keep conditions simple:** La logique complexe doit se trouver dans une tâche Script précédente qui produit une valeur simple pour la condition"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Use task codes:** Reference prior task results by code rather than name"
" for stability"
msgstr "**Use task codes:** Référencez les résultats de tâches antérieures par code plutôt que par nom pour la stabilité"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:134
msgid ""
"**Test both branches:** Ensure both the If and Else workflows handle "
"their scenarios completely"
msgstr "**Test both branches:** Assurez-vous que les workflows If et Else gèrent complètement leurs scénarios"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Handle null values:** Wrap variable references in null checks when "
"values may not be present:"
msgstr "**Handle null values:** Encapsulez les références de variables dans des vérifications de nullité lorsque les valeurs peuvent être absentes :"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:137
msgid "(\"<%= customOptions.skipDeploy %>\" || \"false\") === \"true\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:141
msgid ""
"**Use RESULT TYPE wisely:** When chaining tasks before a conditional, set"
" appropriate result types (Single Value, JSON) so values are accessible"
msgstr "**Use RESULT TYPE wisely:** Lors de l'enchaînement de tâches avant une condition, définissez des types de résultat appropriés (Single Value, JSON) pour rendre les valeurs accessibles"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:144
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exemples"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:146
msgid "**Route deployment by environment:**"
msgstr "**Route deployment by environment:**"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:148
msgid "\"<%= customOptions.targetEnv %>\" === \"production\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:152
msgid ""
"If true → Production Deployment Workflow (with approvals, blue-green, "
"etc.)"
msgstr "Si vrai → Production Deployment Workflow (avec approbations, blue-green, etc.)"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:153
msgid "If false → Development Deployment Workflow (direct deploy)"
msgstr "Si faux → Development Deployment Workflow (déploiement direct)"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:155
msgid "**Conditional backup before update:**"
msgstr "**Conditional backup before update:**"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:157
msgid "\"<%= customOptions.skipBackup %>\" !== \"true\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:161
msgid "If true → Pre-Update Backup Workflow"
msgstr "Si vrai → Pre-Update Backup Workflow"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:162
msgid "If false → Skip backup (empty workflow or no-op)"
msgstr "Si faux → Ignorer la sauvegarde (workflow vide ou no-op)"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:164
msgid "**Scale decision based on metrics:**"
msgstr "**Scale decision based on metrics:**"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:166
msgid "parseInt(\"<%= results.checkMetrics %>\") > 80"
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:170
msgid "If true → Scale Out Workflow"
msgstr "Si vrai → Scale Out Workflow"

#: ../../provisioning/automation/conditional_workflows.rst:171
msgid "If false → Normal Operation Workflow (no-op)"
msgstr "Si faux → Normal Operation Workflow (no-op)"

